{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-22","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If there be any number of magnitudes whatever, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali.","book":5,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","contentId":"euclid-5-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"139cd04a4fa3a53b8fe602018a321d40fa232c14f0bc5a0762451b1e00637c9a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-22.statement","euclid-5-22.construction.1","euclid-5-22.proof.1","euclid-5-22.proof.2","euclid-5-22.proof.3","euclid-5-22.proof.4","euclid-5-22.proof.5","euclid-5-22.proof.6","euclid-5-22.conclusion","euclid-5-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f33bebb001dbdefdb53ddbf9b895640ec845a4f9c6689da0525d55c2f46c79f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be any number of magnitudes whatever, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有数量大小的大小, 和数量相等的, 两者加在一起, 比例相同, 它们也会在平等的基础上处于相同的比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb24df5664e767ad7317c77c792cbcc38ced7821fbd57ca9506c39c69911da4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be any number of magnitudes A, B, C, and others D, E, F equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, so that, as A is to B, so is D to E, and, as B is to C, so is E to F; I say that they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali, ltthat is, as A is to C, so is D to Fgt."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A、B、C等等等值数与其他D、E、F等值数相同,两者加在一起,比例相同,A至B等值等于D至E,B等值等于E至F;我说,它们也处于平等前相同比例,也就是说,A至C等值等于D至C等值；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99f54dd9fcd08faee653204eb6767e431a4072d29a59bce5bab1f3d02af06d10","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For of A, D let equimultiples G, H be taken, and of B, E other, chance, equimultiples K, L; and, further, of C, F other, chance, equimultiples M, N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,D,同倍数,G,H,B,B,E,其他机会,同倍数,K,L;以及C,F,其他机会,同倍数,M,N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcd2e3dd8123a02e2002ebbd29a03e56ea2b1c4a7df116a1897521815874d5e2","citations":["euclid-5-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since, as A is to B, so is D to E, and of A, D equimultiples G, H have been taken, and of B, E other, chance, equimultiples K, L, therefore, as G is to K, so is H to L. [[V. 4](/principles/euclid-5-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A-B的比等于D-E的比,A、D、同倍数/G、H的比,B、E其他机会,同倍数、K、L的比等于H-L的比；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；G 与 K 之比等于 H 与 L 之比。 [[V. 4](/principles/euclid-5-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"897db6ad754a6f6aa5516b78aa0c9b427b46782b4b2abf83418821a56df9ec09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as K is to M, so is L to N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,K比M的比例等于L比N；K 与 M 之比等于 L 与 N 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38512d88a2196a550cb5b881a3999d5dbcd44c126b6f0eb5c95c046b75e5127b","citations":["euclid-5-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, there are three magnitudes G, K, M, and others H, L, N equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, therefore, ex aequali, if G is in excess of M, H is also in excess of N; if equal, equal; and if less, less. [[V. 20](/principles/euclid-5-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,共有3级G、K、M和H等,其余H、L、N等,两者加在一起,比例相同,因此,如果G以上M、H以上,则在平等基础上;如果平等,则在平等基础上;如果较少,则在平等基础上。 [[V. 20](/principles/euclid-5-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2013219c1cd399f4b7ea4dab90413bb00460a2b9cf6847da2131e34def4e352","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And G, H are equimultiples of A, D, and M, N other, chance, equimultiples of C, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,H是A,D的同倍数 还有M,N会,C,F的同倍数个"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"265c26a4bacca2f7d11580b7c5941997736704c8c1ce38b9917c4c37fdd8372f","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to C, so is D to F. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比C等于D比F；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-22.source","contentId":"euclid-5-22","revisionId":"euclid-5-22@raw-139cd04a4fa3a53b","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e7bb4c130e5c9c025669421193256204cf4f732b36ff163172d8a997b749998","cita